git remote set-url origin https://github.com/phyzioline/inventory-app.git

# SSH (needs deploy key on this server)
git remote set-url origin git@github.com:phyzioline/inventory-app.git

# Fresh clone
gh repo clone phyzioline/inventory-app
```

Before `git commit` / `git push` / claims about `Modules/Ecommerce` / clinics:

```bash
pwd && git remote -v
```

If you see `Modules/` paths or clinic booking — you are in the **wrong** project.
